#: web-components/README.md
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"# {{projectName}}\n"
"\n"
"A plain TypeScript app (via Vite) styled with\n"
"[`@pantoken/components`](https://www.npmjs.com/package/@pantoken/components) "
"and using\n"
"framework-agnostic custom elements from\n"
"[`@pantoken/web-components`](https://www.npmjs.com/package/@pantoken/web-"
"components).\n"
"\n"
"## Develop\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"npm install\n"
"npm run dev\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"## What's here\n"
"\n"
"- `src/main.ts` imports `@pantoken/css` (defines every `--instui-*` custom "
"property),\n"
"  `@pantoken/components/base.css` + `components.css` (`.instui-*` classes),\n"
"  `@pantoken/interactions` (wires up modal, tooltip, and other component "
"behaviors out of the\n"
"  box), and `@pantoken/web-components` (auto-registers elements like "
"`<instui-icon>`), then\n"
"  renders markup into `#app`.\n"
"- Optional insertion points (header, filters, content, trailing) are marked "
"with\n"
"  `<div data-slot=\"...\">` — replace their contents with your own markup.\n"
"- Use custom elements directly in markup, e.g. `<instui-button>`, `<instui-"
"alert variant=\"success\">` —\n"
"  see the [`@pantoken/web-components` README](https://www.npmjs.com/package/"
"@pantoken/web-components)\n"
"  for the full element list.\n"
"\n"
"## Learn more\n"
"\n"
"See the [HTML guide](https://pantoken.app/guide/components) to learn more.\n"
msgstr ""
"# {{projectName}}\n"
"\n"
"Una aplicación TypeScript sencilla (vía Vite) estilizada con\n"
"[`@pantoken/components`](https://www.npmjs.com/package/@pantoken/components) "
"y que usa\n"
"elementos personalizados agnósticos al framework desde\n"
"[`@pantoken/web-components`](https://www.npmjs.com/package/@pantoken/web-"
"components).\n"
"\n"
"## Desarrollar\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"npm install\n"
"npm run dev\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"## Qué hay aquí\n"
"\n"
"- `src/main.ts` importa `@pantoken/css` (define cada propiedad personalizada "
"`--instui-*`),\n"
"  `@pantoken/components/base.css` + `components.css` (`.instui-*` clases),\n"
"  `@pantoken/interactions` (conecta modal, tooltip y otros comportamientos "
"de componentes listos para usar), y `@pantoken/web-components` "
"(autorregistra elementos como `<instui-icon>`), luego\n"
"  renderiza marcado dentro de `#app`.\n"
"- Los puntos de inserción opcionales (header, filters, content, trailing) "
"están marcados con\n"
"  `<div data-slot=\"...\">` — reemplaza su contenido con tu propio marcado.\n"
"- Usa elementos personalizados directamente en el marcado, p. ej. `<instui-"
"button>`, `<instui-alert variant=\"success\">` —\n"
"  consulta el [README de `@pantoken/web-components`](https://www.npmjs.com/"
"package/@pantoken/web-components)\n"
"  para la lista completa de elementos.\n"
"\n"
"## Aprende más\n"
"\n"
"Consulta la [guía de HTML](https://pantoken.app/guide/components) para saber "
"más.\n"
